  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "geton & him \u00feis word w\u00e6s behydd. \u00dea he geneal\u00e6hte Hiericho, sum blind man s\u00e6t wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne weg w\u00e6dligende. & \u00fea he gehyrde \u00fea menego farende, he ahsude hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re. \u00d0a s\u00e6don hig \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r ferde se Nazareniscea H\u00e6lend. \u00dea hrymde he & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala H\u00e6lend, Dauides sunu, gemiltsa me. & \u00fea \u00f0e forestopun hine \u00fereadon \u00fe\u00e6t he suwude. \u00d0\u00e6s \u00fee ma he clypode, Dauides sunu, gemiltsa me. \u00d0a stod se H\u00e6lend & het hine l\u00e6dan to him, \u00fea he geneal\u00e6hte he ahsude hine, hw\u00e6t wylt \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t ic geseo. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend, beseoh \u00fein geleafa \u00fee geh\u00e6lde. And he sona geseah, & him folgode God wuldrigende & eall folc Gode lof sealde \u00fea hig \u00fe\u00e6t \u00d0a eode he geond Iericho. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fear sum man on naman Zacheus, Se w\u00e6s welig & he wolde geseon hwylc se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re. \u00dea ne mihte he for \u00f0\u00e6re menegu, for\u00feam \u00fee he w\u00e6s lytel on w\u00e6stmum, \u00fea arn he beforan & stah up \u00dea he com to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fea geseah se H\u00e6lend hine & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Zacheus efst to \u00feinum huse for\u00feam \u00fee ic \u00d0a efste he & hine bli\u00feelice onfengc. \u00dea hig \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon \u00fea murcnudun hig ealle, & c",
